"When not using system colors, set the color for all day events marked as busy"
msgstr ""
"عند عدم استخدام ألوان النظام، اضبط لون الأحداث طوال اليوم المعلَّمة كمشغولة"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ViewBgBusyColor), group (Colors)
#: eventviews.kcfg:363
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In Agenda and Month views, when you have an all day event marked as busy, "
